    "message": "fix(install): restore the uv helpers dropped from install.ps1\n\nStripping the coding-agent code took Get-UvVersion, Convert-UvVersionOutput,\nTest-UvVersionAtLeast, and Confirm-Uv with it, because they sat between the\nagent functions and Ensure-Uv. The script parsed cleanly and only failed when\nactually run -- 'Get-UvVersion is not recognized' -- and the PowerShell\ninstaller tests do not run on the Linux CI runners, so nothing caught it.\n\nAdds a static test asserting both scripts still define every helper they rely\non, which fails in CI on any platform.",
